      "title": "Subscribed / registered",
      "description": "End to end conversion. A revenue number needs Stripe, which Prometheus never sees; this is the count that leads it.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 7,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 27
